{{etyl|LL.|en}} {{lena}} {{m|la|amma}}, probably of interjectional or imitative origin: compare {{cog|es|ama}}, German {{m|de|Amme}}, nurse, Basque {{m|eu|ama}} mother, {{etyl|he|-}}, {{etyl|ar|-}}.

